@startuml
' Evidence: Laplace-Conventional/src/laplace_conventional/cli.py SHA256 36d0a136f9cbe4f76c959b641b3d9b2dc676619caa633c1b8724fa8ec11f1359
' Evidence: Laplace-Conventional/src/laplace_conventional/model.py SHA256 ebe14acd67abea5865458e8f6e707e086a09f60812fa6e3e205a86b7309ddd7d
' Evidence: Laplace-Conventional/src/laplace_conventional/modality_models.py SHA256 3b6cdf34e7ba0e77da7fb7ac2f11c825e903aecac8eb5de466c213b61b28057d
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Conventional — language and modality model construction
start
if (Language model?) then (yes)
 :Read generated model configuration;
 :Construct LlamaConfig: heads = key/value heads;
 :BOS 1 / EOS 2 / PAD 3; tie embeddings; disable cache;
 :Instantiate LlamaForCausalLM from config;
else (modality)
 if (Provider image-vit-mae?) then (yes)
  :Configure RGB ViTMAE encoder/decoder, patches, masking and pixel loss;
 elseif (Provider audio-wav2vec2?) then (yes)
  :Configure Wav2Vec2 transformer, masking, negatives and codebook;
 elseif (Provider video-videomae?) then (yes)
  :Configure RGB VideoMAE frames, tubelets, patches and encoder/decoder;
 else (unknown)
  :Raise unsupported provider;
  stop
 endif
 :Instantiate corresponding pretraining model;
endif
:When planning, count actual parameter elements;
:Estimate largest layer as min(total, ceil(total / max(1,layers) * 2));
stop
footer
Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. All local model constructors and parameter_stats reviewed. These instantiate
standard external transformer architectures from configuration; they do not load
pretrained weights here. The largest-layer statistic is an estimate, not measured peak
memory or inspection of the largest concrete layer. Provider internals remain external.
end footer

@enduml
